@ ROULETTE, ported from Emerald. Emerald gated a "special rate" table behind
@ POKeNEWS, which FireRed does not have, so the two tables are plain here and
@ the special-rate message is left in for a flag to switch on later.
@
@ VAR_0x8004 picks the table: 0 or 1, plus ROULETTE_SPECIAL_RATE for the
@ better odds.

Roulette_EventScript_Table1::
	checkitem ITEM_COIN_CASE
	goto_if_eq VAR_RESULT, FALSE, Roulette_EventScript_NoCoinCase
	setvar VAR_0x8004, 0
	goto Roulette_EventScript_Play
	end

Roulette_EventScript_Table2::
	checkitem ITEM_COIN_CASE
	goto_if_eq VAR_RESULT, FALSE, Roulette_EventScript_NoCoinCase
	setvar VAR_0x8004, 1
	goto Roulette_EventScript_Play
	end

Roulette_EventScript_Play::
	special PlayRoulette
	waitstate
@ Emerald reached these tables through a signpost, which locks and releases on
@ its own. MANDARIN reaches them through a croupier, so the release is here.
	release
	end

Roulette_EventScript_NoCoinCase::
	msgbox Roulette_Text_YouDontHaveACoinCase, MSGBOX_DEFAULT
	release
	end

